	(text "R602 (105 kOhm) and R603 (20 kOhm) set USB_RAW:\nVRAW = 0.8 V x (1 + R602/R603) = 5.00 V.\nTo change the voltage: R602 = R603 x (VRAW/0.8 V - 1). Increasing the upper\nresistor raises VRAW."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
